        "id": "add_native_swift_tests",
        "instruction": "Edit macos/FractalVoice/Tests/FractalVoiceTests/FractalVoiceTests.swift to add temporary project.fractal fixtures for a legacy graph with no learning fields, a fully enriched graph containing all controlled records and a graph outcome, a partially populated graph, and a graph with unknown future controlled strings. Test Codable parsing, fallback behavior, concise node and graph formatting, BuildCoordinator active-project loading, and the relevant HUD/status presentation without starting a real build. Assert no crash and no false corruption status for missing additive data. Do not edit production Swift, Rust, Package.swift, generated resources, signing settings, or dist-* paths.",
        "kind": "container",
