        "instruction": "Create macos/FractalVoice/Sources/FractalVoice/ProjectGraphLearning.swift containing additive Codable projections for fractal.project.v1, enriched graph nodes, executor, verification, artifact references, human intervention, controlled outcomes/failure codes, graph-edit events, and graph outcome summaries. Make every new learning field optional or safely defaulted so legacy and partially enriched project.fractal files decode; retain raw unknown controlled strings for forward-compatible display rather than crashing. Provide pure formatting helpers for concise node outcome/attempt/verification text and graph completion summaries. Do not edit BuildCoordinator.swift, views, tests, Rust files, Package.swift, generated resources, or dist-* paths.",
